ities, generating annual revenue exceeding 30 million yuan. In Zhenjiang, a century-old vinegar maker has opened its ancient brewing craft production scenes to the public, letting visitors try their hand at flipping fermentation mash; the Vinegar Culture Museum sees 20% annual visitor growth, with cultural-tourism revenue topping 10 million yuan. Seven government departments have issued policies to support industrial tourism, opening up diverse offerings such as production-line tours and hands-on experiences. In 2025, China's industrial tourism total revenue reached 120 billion yuan, up 10% year-over-year. Research institutions forecast China's industrial tourism will grow at an average annual rate of 18%, with the market expected to surpass 300 billion yuan by 2029, leaving broad room for industry expansion. (CCTV Finance)", "rank_score": 24.53}, {"title": "\u5174\u4e1a\u94f6\u884c\u5317\u4eac\u5206\u884c\u6df1\u5165\u5f00\u5c55\u91d1\u878d\u77e5\u8bc6\u666e\u53ca", "summary": "", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-08-14/doc-ininfmnc9617670.shtml", "time": "2026-08-14", "theme": "markets", "source": "cn_news_page", "source_name": "\u65b0\u6d6a\u8d22\u7ecf\u80a1\u7968", "source_lang": "zh", "source_tier": "china_native", "wire_important": false, "importance_score": 54, "intelligence_score": 72, "importance": "medium", "importance_reasons": ["native Chinese financial source", "dashboard core theme"], "channels": ["markets"], "tickers": ["512800.SS"], "ticker_reasons": {"512800.SS": "\u94f6\u884c"}, "related_tickers": [{"ticker": "512800.SS", "reason": "\u94f6\u884c"}], "title_zh": "\u5174\u4e1a\u94f6\u884c\u5317\u4eac\u5206\u884c\u6df1\u5165\u5f00\u5c55\u91d1\u878d\u77e5\u8bc6\u666e\u53ca", "title_en": "Industrial Bank Beijing Branch deepens financial knowledge promotion", "rank_score": 23.54}, {"title": "8\u670813\u65e5\u6caa\u6df1\u4e24\u5e02\u6da8\u505c\u5206\u6790\uff1a\u79e6\u5b89\u80a1\u4efd5\u8fde\u677f\uff0c\u540c\u529b\u5929\u542f\u3001\u7687\u6c0